IMAPStore gmail-remote
Host imap.gmail.com
SSLType IMAPS
AuthMechs XOAUTH2
User me@jeltef.nl
PassCmd "oama access me@jeltef.nl"

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/mail/
Inbox ~/mail/INBOX/
Subfolders Verbatim

Channel gmail-pg
Far :gmail-remote:"! Postgres"
Near :gmail-local:Postgres
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Channel gmail-pg-interesting
Far :gmail-remote:"! Postgres/Interesting"
Near :gmail-local:Interesting
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Channel gmail-drafts
Far :gmail-remote:[Gmail]/Drafts
Near :gmail-local:Drafts
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
